onymous horse of the film series, and she also makes friends with Mika. Mika and Ari try to save the estate and protect Windstorm from reckless horse trainer Thordur Thorvaldson.","tagline":"Aris Arrival"},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Großmutter Maria, Sam und der Reitlehrer Kaan versuchen gemeinsam, Gut Kaltenbach am Laufen zu halten, das in finanziellen Schwierigkeiten steckt. Die ehrgeizige Isabell unterstützt sie dabei, obwohl sie insgeheim ihre eigenen Ziele verfolgt. Die impulsive Ari kommt zum Reittraining nach Kaltenbach, dort entwickelt sie eine besondere Beziehung zu Ostwind, dem titelgebenden Pferd der Filmreihe, und auch mit Mika freundet sie sich an. Mika und Ari versuchen gemeinsam, das Gut zu retten und Ostwind vor dem rücksichtslosen Pferdetrainer Thordur Thorvaldson zu beschützen."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5wvQrC7Z6OPAiPeEA8Cin2JLkzb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xSlBUHpWEz194k1djYiO0bgQ9pY.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":550755,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5wvQrC7Z6OPAiPeEA8Cin2JLkzb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5wvQrC7Z6OPAiPeEA8Cin2JLkzb.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2250},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5wvQrC7Z6OPAiPeEA8Cin2JLkzb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5wvQrC7Z6OPAiPeEA8Cin2JLkzb.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2250}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8JNrBpYN7WksXUHUg0akV7XMgGq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8JNrBpYN7WksXUHUg0akV7XMgGq.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/origina